   "sentenceId": 4,
   "he": "וְכַמָּה? אָמַר רַבִּי אַבָּא אָמַר רַבִּי יִרְמְיָה אָמַר רַב: כׇּל שִׁבְעַת יְמֵי הַמִּשְׁתֶּה. וְרַבָּנַן מִשְּׁמֵיהּ דְּרָבָא אָמְרִי: אֲפִילּוּ מִיּוֹם רִאשׁוֹן וְאֵילָךְ.",
   "en": "The Gemara asks: «And» for «how long» is the groomsman disqualified? «Rabbi Abba says» that «Rabbi Yirmeya says» that «Rav says:» Throughout «all of the seven days of feasting. And the Rabbis say in the name of Rava: Even from the first day» after the wedding «and onward» he is no longer disqualified; he is disqualified only on the wedding day itself."
  }
